# Rendered media, stills and 3D frame caches stay on this machine; they are never committed.
# The engine's small input art (below) is committed so the film can be rebuilt from Git.
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.wav
*.png
*.jpg
*.zip
source/renders/
source/engine/assets/fonts/SF-Mono-*
source/engine/assets/fonts/ArialBlack.ttf
source/engine/assets/fonts/DINCondensedBold.ttf
.DS_Store
!source/engine/assets/*.png
!source/engine/assets/posters/*.jpg
!source/engine/assets/products/*.jpg
